WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.650
A list keeps many values in order, under one name.

2
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:07.850
Here is a list of three colours, called colours.

3
00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:13.400
Each item has a place, counted from zero. Place zero is red.

4
00:00:14.101 --> 00:00:18.376
The len of colours counts the items, so the loop runs three times.
